{"suttaId":"tha-ap137","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6131,6152],"vripara":"34"},"segments":{"tha-ap137:0.3":"Rahosaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap137:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, vasabho nāma pabbato;","tha-ap137:1.3":"Tasmiṃ pabbatapādamhi, assamo āsi māpito.","tha-ap137:2.1":"“Tīṇi sissasahassāni, vācesiṃ brāhmaṇo [brāhmaṇe (sī.)] tadā;","tha-ap137:2.3":"Saṃharitvāna [saṃsāvitvāna (syā.)] te sisse, ekamantaṃ upāvisiṃ.","tha-ap137:3.1":"“Ekamantaṃ nisīditvā, brāhmaṇo mantapāragū;","tha-ap137:3.3":"Buddhavedaṃ gavesanto [pavesanto (ka.)], ñāṇe cittaṃ pasādayiṃ.","tha-ap137:4.1":"“Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, nisīdiṃ paṇṇasanthare;","tha-ap137:4.3":"Pallaṅkaṃ ābhujitvāna, tattha kālaṅkato ahaṃ.","tha-ap137:5.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap137:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ñāṇasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap137:6.1":"“Sattavīsatikappamhi, rājā siridharo ahu;","tha-ap137:6.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap137:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap137:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā rahosaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap137:9.1":"Rahosaññakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2958,"to":2958,"paras":[{"para":2958,"vripara":"34","refs":["tha-ap137:1"],"lines":["So tattha jhānasukhena ciraṃ vasitvā imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kulagehe nibbatto kāmesu anallīno sattavassiko pabbajitvā khuraggeyeva arahattaṃ patvā chaḷabhiñño hutvā pubbenivāsañāṇena attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā sañjātasomanasso pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>himavantassāvidūre</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Vasabho nāma pabbato</b>ti himavantapabbataṃ vinā sesapabbatānaṃ uccatarabhāvena seṭṭhatarabhāvena vasabhoti saṅkhaṃ gato pabbatoti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap137:1"],["tha-ap137:1"],["tha-ap137:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap137:1.1","himavantassāvidūre",0,0],["tha-ap137:1.1","vasabho nāma pabbato",0,1]]},"tika":null}
